			"Message": "docs(Rest): Expand Funding section with backer logos and introductory text\n\nAdd a proper table header row and introductory paragraph to the Funding & Acknowledgements section of README.md, making the relationship between Land, PlayForm, NLnet, and NGI0 Commons Fund visually clear. Also soften the Changelog call-to-action phrasing.\n\n- Introduce a `<thead>` row labeling the four partner columns\n- Lowercase the editor.land URL in the Land logo link\n- Add a preamble explaining that Land is an NLnet-supported open-source project\n- Rephrase the Changelog link from \"See CHANGELOG.md\" to \"Stay updated with our progress! See CHANGELOG.md\"\n\nVisual and copy polish only — no semantic changes.",
